# Split files are the source of truth:
#   .env.vars.example      GitHub Variables (`gh variable set -f`)
#   .env.secrets.example   GitHub Secrets   (`gh secret set -f`)
#
# Local / Docker: copy those to `.env.vars` and `.env.secrets`, fill in, then:
#   pnpm env:merge
# That writes `.env` (Vite, Express, Compose).
